{"id":"4deff85a84639467","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-submodule.md","title":"Submodule","display":"df-submodule — Submodule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-submodule","aliases":["58-df-submodule","Submodule"],"display":"df-submodule — Submodule","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-submodule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-submodule</span><span>Submodule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-submodule — Submodule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq M\">\\(N\\subseteq M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submodule} \\vdash \\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(+_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(\\odot(\\langle r,x\\rangle)\\in N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submodule} \\vdash \\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(+_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(\\odot(\\langle r,x\\rangle)\\in N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Submodule: closed under module action; generalization of subgroup/vector subspace</li>\n<li>All ring, additive-group, and scalar-action parameters are retained from the upstream module signature.</li>\n<li>The quotient module <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M/N\">\\(M/N\\)</span> is a downstream construction available once <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\leq_R M\">\\(N\\leq_R M\\)</span>; it is not part of the submodule definition.</li>\n<li>Direct sum: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\cong N \\oplus P \\iff M = N + P\">\\(M \\cong N \\oplus P \\iff M = N + P\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N \\cap P = \\{0\\}\">\\(N \\cap P = \\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Noetherian: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> Noetherian <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> all submodules are finitely generated</li>\n<li>Simple: module with no proper submodules; irreducible representations</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Introduction to Commutative Algebra</li>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"N\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}submodule} \\vdash \\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\subseteq M\\land0_M\\in N\\land\\forall x,y\\in N\\;(+_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\in N)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in N\\;(\\odot(\\langle r,x\\rangle)\\in N)","display":true},{"tex":"M/N","display":false},{"tex":"N\\leq_R M","display":false},{"tex":"M \\cong N \\oplus P \\iff M = N + P","display":false},{"tex":"N \\cap P = \\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"153f6e55df144344","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])"},{"id":"c3fc2cb31dd5754f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])"},{"id":"1f6aee9023988355","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S$ is the structured submodule predicate from [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]."},{"id":"8235a298a67c2370","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}$（带同一组环境运算的子模谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]）"},{"id":"a8e2f1731b950254","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md|58-df-submodule]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373"]}